             filename="Source/WebKit/WPEPlatform/wpe/WPEGamepad.cpp"
             line="260">Attempts to make a #WPEGamepad rumble for @duration_ms milliseconds.
Returns %TRUE if the rumble effect was played, %FALSE otherwise.</doc>
