      <method name="register" c:identifier="wpe_settings_register" throws="1">
        <doc xml:space="preserve"
             filename="Source/WebKit/WPEPlatform/wpe/WPESettings.cpp"
             line="159">Registers a key to be used for settings. This is only intended to be used by platforms and not applications.

The key must begin with `/wpe-platform/` and not end with `/`. e.g. `/wpe-platform/fonts/hinting`.

Any floating reference of @default_value will be consumed.

It is an error to call this function with a key that has already been registered.</doc>
        <source-position filename="Source/WebKit/WPEPlatform/wpe/WPESettings.h"
                         line="320"/>
        <return-value transfer-ownership="none">
          <type name="gboolean" c:type="gboolean"/>
        </return-value>
